 the 48 indentations was treated as an independent observation, reports n = 24 per arm and df = 45.95 from Welch's t-test on all rows, whereas the declared independent unit yields only 6 coupons per arm (df at most about 10). Repeated measurements from the same coupon entered a row-independent procedure as if independent.\",\"The lock's unit-key authorization does not follow from the declaration alone: it authorizes key column coupon_id for the row-level scipy.stats.ttest_ind procedure, but the declaration states each coupon_id spans four dependent rows, so the declaration contradicts rather than licenses treating rows as independent under that key; the lock's own authority_limitations disclaim any correctness force that could close this gap.\"]}","structured_output":{"declaration_consistent":true,"selected_report_demonstration":"issue","lock_follows_declaration":false,"reasons":["Declaration is consistent with the frozen data: coupon_id C01-C12 each appear on exactly four rows (indent_index 1-4), condition is constant within coupon, and both arms share the six-coupons-by-four-indentations structure (as_built C01-C06, stress_relieved C07-C12), matching the stated one-row-per-indentation, coupon-as-unit declaration.","The selected report demonstrates the issue on its face: it explicitly states each of the 48 indentations was treated as an independent observation, reports n = 24 per arm and df = 45.95 from Welch's t-test on all rows, whereas the declared independent unit yields only 6 coupons per arm (df at most about 10). Repeated measurements from the same coupon entered a row-independent procedure as if independent.","The lock's unit-key authorization does not follow from the declaration alone: it authorizes key column coupon_id for the row-level scipy.stats.ttest_ind procedure, but the declaration states each coupon_id spans four dependent rows, so the declaration contradicts rather than licenses treating rows as independent under that key; the lock's own authority_limitations disclaim any correctness force that could close this gap."]},"ttft_ms":10648,"ttft_stream_ms":1963,"time_to_request_ms":12,"type":"result","duration_ms":24806,"uuid":"99088387-ae14-4dbd-99bf-3413863e741b"}
